flowchart TD
    A[API Request] --> B[Backend Processing]

    B --> C{Error Occurred?}

    C -- No --> D[Return Success Response]

    C -- Yes --> E{Error Type}

    E -- Validation Error --> F[Return 400 Bad Request]
    E -- Authentication Error --> G[Return 401 Unauthorized]
    E -- Permission Error --> H[Return 403 Forbidden]
    E -- Not Found Error --> I[Return 404 Not Found]
    E -- Scanner Failure --> J[Return 500 Scanner Execution Failed]
    E -- AI Failure --> K[Return 500 AI Recommendation Failed]
    E -- Database Error --> L[Return 500 Database Error]

    F --> M[Log Error]
    G --> M
    H --> M
    I --> M
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M

    M --> N[Send Error Response to Client]